<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><meta name="description" content="David Bennett, founder of Mimic Productions and Mimic Minds. Explore digital humans, film credits, speaking and the Mimic ecosystem."/><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' ws://127.0.0.1:4398; frame-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'; media-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'"/><title>Brands | David Bennett</title><link rel="icon" href="/favicon-live.webp"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/questrial.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin/></head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="site-frame">
<header class="masthead"><a class="identity" href="/combined-direction/" aria-label="David Bennett home"><span>DAVID BENNETT<small>FOUNDER · FUTURIST · SPEAKER</small></span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-controls="navigation" aria-expanded="false">Menu <Icon name="plus" size={16}/></button><nav id="navigation" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/combined-direction/brands/">BRANDS</a><a href="/combined-direction/events/">EVENTS</a><a href="/combined-direction/blog/">BLOG</a></nav><a class="button small header-connect" href={linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Let’s connect <Icon name="linkedin" size={17}/></a></header>
<main id="main" class="collection-page"><section class="collection-intro section light"><span class="eyebrow">THE COMPANIES I’M BUILDING</span><h1>The Mimicverse.</h1><p>Hyper-realistic digital humans, conversational AI, real-time 3D assets and visual effects. Explore the companies bringing this work to different industries.</p></section><section class="section dark flagship-grid"><article><img class="flagship-logo productions-logo" src="/images/mimic-productions-logo.png" alt="Mimic Productions"/><h2>Character craft.<br/>Human expression.</h2><p>Digital humans, performance capture and animation for film, games, brands and immersive experiences.</p><a class="button" href="https://www.mimicproductions.com/">Explore Mimic Productions <Icon/></a></article><article><img class="flagship-logo minds-logo" src="/images/mimic-minds-logo.png" alt="Mimic Minds"/><h2>A character.<br/>A conversation.</h2><p>Conversational AI avatars and the tools to create, deploy and interact with digital characters.</p><a class="button" href="https://www.mimicminds.com/">Explore Mimic Minds <Icon/></a></article></section><section class="section light"><div class="collection-heading"><span class="eyebrow">ONE ECOSYSTEM. DIFFERENT POSSIBILITIES.</span><h2>Meet the brands.</h2></div><div class="brand-directory">{brands.map((brand,index)=><a class:list={['directory-card',{'text-only':!brand.image}]} href={brand.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{brand.image&&<img src={brand.image} alt={brand.name} loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"/>}<div><span class="eyebrow">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{brand.name}</h3><p>{brand.description}</p><span class="directory-link">Explore brand <Icon size={16}/></span></div></a>)}</div></section></main><footer class="footer dark"><div class="footer-top"><a class="identity" href="/combined-direction/"><span>DAVID BENNETT<small>FOUNDER · FUTURIST · SPEAKER</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Social profiles"><a href={linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="David on LinkedIn"><Icon name="linkedin" size={18}/></a><a href={imdb} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IMDb</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/davidaaronbennett/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a><a href={email} aria-label="Email David"><Icon name="mail" size={18}/></a></nav><a href="/combined-direction/about/">About</a><a href="/combined-direction/contact/">Contact</a><a href="/combined-direction/" class="back-top">BACK TO TOP <Icon size={15}/></a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} David Bennett</span><span>Mimic Productions <b>·</b> Mimic Minds</span><a href={email}>dbennett@mimicproductions.com</a></div></footer></div><script>const b=document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');const n=document.querySelector('#navigation');b?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const o=b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(o));n?.classList.toggle('open',o)});</script></body></html>